sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Consumer
    participant App as Flutter App
    participant API as Gateway
    participant P as Parser
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant LA as Ledger Agent
    participant AA as Anomaly Agent
    participant VA as Vision Agent
    participant F as Fusion
    participant N as Narrator (Claude)

    C->>App: scan code, photograph pack
    App->>API: POST /scan {payload, format, photos, geo}
    API->>P: parse(payload, format)
    P-->>API: {gtin, serial, batch, expiry, unitLevel}
    API->>O: verify(unitRef, geo, photos)

    par Parallel agent fan-out
        O->>LA: check(serialHash)
        LA-->>O: minted, status, batch
    and
        O->>AA: analyse(serialHash, geo, now)
        AA-->>O: cloneScore, geo evidence
    and
        O->>VA: match(photos, expectedDrug)
        VA-->>O: visualScore
    end

    O->>F: fuse([ledger, anomaly, vision, recall])
    F-->>App: verdict + evidence (renders immediately)

    F->>N: narrate(verdict, evidence)
    N-->>App: plain-language reasons (streamed)

    O->>API: append scan row to log
    Note over O,API: written after response - never blocks the verdict

    alt verdict != GENUINE
        App->>API: GET /alternatives?salt=...&strength=...
        API-->>App: verified substitutes
    end
